@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
' purpose: the order a def entrypoint runs the shell prelude and proveo-entrypoint prep in, and what each one depends on
' covers: cmd/proveo-entrypoint/**
' covers: defs/*/entrypoint.sh
' covers: defs/claudecode/mcp/entrypoint.sh
'
' 2026-10-17, N1 (DONE (wt); repo-simplification.puml): the order is REVERSED.
' MEASURED (e.g. defs/codex/entrypoint.sh:6-16): source the lib, then
' proveo_sbx_passthrough, then the in-shell prelude — set_working_directory,
' bridge_google_keys, bridge_git_identity — and only then `proveo-entrypoint prep`,
' which keeps the passwd entry, the git-context report and the smoke sentinel.
' TestEntrypointsRunTheShellPreludeThenPrep pins the order. HISTORY: prep ran
' first and the shell then redid the chdir and exports prep could not carry.
title Entrypoint startup — the in-shell prelude first, then prep

participant "sbx startup\n(Kit env, cwd)" as SBX <<host>>
participant "defs/<name>/entrypoint.sh" as SH <<app>>
participant "packages/lib/entrypoint-lib.sh\n(sourced INTO the shell)" as LIB <<app>>
participant "proveo-entrypoint prep\n(child)" as PREP <<app>>
participant "agent CLI" as AGENT <<app>>

SBX ARROW_MAIN SH : PID 1, env from the Kit / ""-e"" / ""--env-file""
SH ARROW_MAIN LIB : " ""source /entrypoint-lib.sh"" "

group in-shell prelude — the steps the agent must inherit
  SH ARROW_MAIN LIB : " ""set_working_directory /app"" "
  LIB ARROW_MAIN SH : cwd now the mounted scope
  SH ARROW_MAIN LIB : " ""bridge_google_keys"" · ""bridge_git_identity"" "
  LIB ARROW_MAIN SH : Google key aliases + git identity exported;\nno workspace .env is read (N7)
  SH ARROW_MAIN LIB : harness bridge\n(""apply_env_bridges"" / ""CURSOR_MODEL"" / ""ANTHROPIC_MODEL"")
end

group prep — process-external setup only
  SH ARROW_MAIN PREP : " ""prep <target> || true"" "
  PREP ARROW_MAIN PREP : passwd entry · git-context report (sees the shell's cwd)
  PREP ARROW_OPTIONAL SH : smoke mode: sentinel, then sleep
end

SH ARROW_MAIN SH : preamble — versions, detected config,\n" ""PROVEO_MODELS main=… small=…"" "
SH ARROW_MAIN AGENT : " ""exec <agent> \"$@\""" "
AGENT ARROW_MAIN AGENT : inherits cwd + bridged env

note over SH, LIB
  **No .env step.** The project "".env"" reaches a new
  sandbox from the host through ""--env-file""; neither
  ""prep"" nor the shell reads it (N7).
end note

note over AGENT
  ""PROVEO_MODELS"" is the assertable contract: one
  machine-greppable line naming the model each harness
  actually resolved. e2e asserts it instead of
  trusting the model's prose — see
  _spec/tests/42-hello-world-e2e.puml
end note
@enduml
